}}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "JWInteger"}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["## 🥒mode（模式）：\n\ntiny → 更快（默认）；full→ 更高的质量\n\n## 🥒比例（放大倍数）：\n通常使用4效果更好；如果明显存在不足，可使用2\n\n## 🥒color_fix（颜色修改）：\n使用小波变换方法修改输出视频的颜色偏差。\n\n## 🥒tiled_vae（VAE分块解码）：\n启用后可显着降低显着的存储占用，但会降低解码速度。\n\n## 🥒tiled_dit（DiT分块计算）：\n大幅减少显着的占用占用，但会降低推理速度。\n\n## 🥒tile_size /tile_overlap（分块大小与重叠）：\n控制输入视频在推理时的分块方式。\n\n## 🥒unload_dit（卸载DiT模型）：\n解码前卸载DiT模型以降低速度显着存高，但会小幅降低。\n\n## 🥒local_range(上下文参考)\nlocal_range 值越大： 模型需要同时处理更多的视频帧数据。这意味着更高的计算成本、更大的显存占用和更长的处理时间。\nlocal_range 值越小： 模型处理的帧数较少，因此计算速度会更快，显存占用更低。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "使用说明：", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [367.8783874511719, 532.35888671875], "pos": [781.4895629882812, 1302.701904296875], "id": 22, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "any", "links": [33, 35], "label": "any", "type": "*", "localized_name": "any"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": [true, true], "inputs": [{"name": "anything", "link": 27, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}, {"widget": {"name": "purge_cache"}, "name": "purge_cache", "label": "purge_cache", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "purge_cache"}, {"widget": {"name": "purge_models"}, "name": "purge_models", "label": "purge_models", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "purge_models"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "LayerUtility: PurgeVRAM V2", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [358.28521728515625, 82], "pos": [789.879638671875, 1175.0709228515625], "id": 25, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LayerUtility: PurgeVRAM V2"}, "order": 15}, {"outputs": [{"name": "Filenames", "label": "Filenames", "type": "VHS_FILENAMES", "localized_name": "Filenames"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": {"save_output": true, "filename_prefix": "GensorAI_FlashVSR", "loop_count": 0, "pix_fmt": "yuv420p", "save_metad